    title: "swift: a value chain v.p.m() is typed by its HEAD v, so receiver_type_hint / the module slot name the wrong type (1,020 sites on 4 repos, 20/20 sampled wrong) -- and the Channel.addHandler net_send row matches only through that error"  # 99b3
